# Mobile_Appium_TestNG Automation Framework

This is a Test Automation framework for mobile applications using **Appium**, **TestNG**, and **Maven**.

---

## Prerequisites

- Java: JDK 17 or higher
- Maven: 3.9.11 (or latest)
- Appium Server: Installed and running
- TestNG: Configured in the project
- Mobile device or emulator configured for testing

---

## How to Set Up

1. Clone the repository
 cd Mobile_Automation
 git clone https://github.com/SachinChine99/Mobile_Appium_TestNG

2. Install dependencies and build the project
mvn clean install -DskipTests

3. Running Tests
mvn clean install -DsuiteXmlFile=TestNG/testNG.xml


